---

<section id="cities" class="py-20 md:py-32 bg-[#0B0C10] relative overflow-hidden" aria-labelledby="cities-heading">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#DC2626]/10 border border-[#DC2626]/30 text-[#DC2626] text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">
        <Sparkles class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-[#F59E0B]" />
        <span>Réseau Local Suisse Dédié</span>
      </div>

      <h2 id="cities-heading" class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black text-white tracking-tight mb-4">
        IPTV Suisse Disponible Dans <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-[#DC2626] to-[#EF4444]">Tous les Cantons</span>
      </h2>

      <p class="text-gray-300 text-base sm:text-lg font-normal">
        Nos serveurs de diffusion sont connectés directement aux points d'échange suisses (SwissIX). Profitez d'une latence minimale et d'un temps de zapping instantané quelle que soit votre ville.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Cities Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      {cities.map((city) => (
        <a
          href={`/locations/${city.slug}`}
          class="group rounded-2xl bg-[#12141D] border border-white/[0.08] p-6 hover:border-[#DC2626]/50 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 shadow-lg hover:shadow-[0_12px_30px_rgba(220,38,38,0.15)] flex flex-col justify-between"
          title={`Découvrir IPTV Suisse à ${city.name}`}
        >
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-[#DC2626]/15 border border-[#DC2626]/30 flex items-center justify-center text-[#DC2626]">
                  <MapPin class="w-4 h-4" />
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white group-hover:text-[#DC2626] transition-colors">
                  {city.name}
                </h3>
              </div>
              <span class="text-[10px] font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-white/[0.06] text-gray-300 border border-white/[0.08]">
                {city.canton}
              </span>
            </div>

            <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-4">
              {city.description}
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="pt-4 border-t border-white/[0.06] flex items-center justify-between text-xs">
            <span class="text-gray-400">{city.region}</span>
            <span class="text-[#DC2626] font-semibold flex items-center gap-1 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform">
              Accéder à la ville <ArrowRight class="w-3.5 h-3.5" />
            </span>
          </div>
        </a>
      ))}
    </div>

    <!-- Bottom Reassurance -->
    <div class="mt-12 text-center text-xs text-gray-400">
      <p>
        🇨🇭 Vous habitez une autre commune suisse ? Notre service est 100% compatible sur l'ensemble des 26 cantons suisses avec tous les opérateurs internet (Swisscom, Sunrise, Salt, Wingo, VTX, Net+).
      </p>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
